@startuml models
!include theme.iuml
title Crafty — local STEP handoff and model publication
top to bottom direction

state "Build job (when needed)" as Build {
  state "Queued\nfrozen source + inputs" as BuildQueued
  state "Building\nisolated FreeCAD attempt" as Building
  state "Built\nSTEP staged; build job complete" as Built
  state "Build failed / cancelled" as BuildFailed #FCE9E7
  BuildQueued -down-> Building
  Building -down-> Built
  Building -right-> BuildFailed : error / timeout / Stop
  BuildQueued -right-> BuildFailed : Stop before execution
}

state "Local STEP + source files\nagent-visible folder" as Local
state "Publication operation" as Publication {
  state "Ingesting\nmodel_publish(stepPath, sourcePath, parentRevisionId)" as Ingesting
  state "Verifying\nfrozen submitted STEP; isolated attempt" as Verifying
  state "Complete staged artifact set" as Staged
  state "Publish gate" as Gate <<choice>>
  state "Ready revision\nimmutable manifest + durable event" as Ready #E8F3EC
  state "Failed / cancelled / fenced" as Failed #FCE9E7
  Ingesting -down-> Verifying : capture exact bytes; enqueue verification
  Verifying -down-> Staged : valid geometry + GLB + PNG + report
  Staged -down-> Gate : compare attempt lease + cancellation fence
  Gate -down-> Ready : commit all references atomically
  Gate -right-> Failed : stale attempt / Stop
  Verifying -right-> Failed : invalid geometry / resource limit / Stop
  Ingesting -right-> Failed : incomplete files / invalid source / Stop
}

[*] -down-> BuildQueued
Built -down-> Local : MCP downloads completed output
Local -down-> Ingesting : explicit submission by agent
Ready -down-> [*]

note left of Local
  Existing local STEP + source may enter here.
  A worker path is not automatically an agent path.
  Folder contents do not automatically become chat assets.
end note
note right of Verifying
  Reopen the exact submitted STEP.
  Derive GLB and fixed-camera PNG from that geometry.
  Record units and coordinate conversion.
  No generated Python runs in the verifier.
end note
note right of Ready
  revisionId + parentRevisionId + file digests
  source.py + parameters.json + part.step
  preview.glb + verification PNGs + validation.json
  A new design gets a new revision; old files stay intact.
end note
note bottom of Publication
  Build jobs, publication jobs, ACP turns, and revisions have independent states.
  Retrying unchanged input uses a new attempt ID and the same operation identity.
  Older completion cannot silently replace a newer selected revision.
  Local path is a transfer input; assetId / revisionId is the durable identity.
end note
@enduml
